369	// The invoices raised against a project: what they add up to, a form to raise another, and a drill-in
370	// to each invoice's line items and payments. Owns its own invoice state, scoped to the one project.
371	// Whenever the invoices change (a new one raised, a status moved, a line item edited) the owner is
372	// told so figures derived from them — the budget's invoiced/remaining — can be refreshed.
373	function ProjectInvoices({
374	  projectId,
375	  onInvoicesChanged,
376	}: {
377	  projectId: number;
378	  onInvoicesChanged: () => void;
379	}) {
